{
  "company_name": "MidStream Dynamics",
  "industry": "Oil & Gas Midstream",
  "use_case": "Scenario planning and business simulation for midstream pipeline operations",
  "space_title": "MidStream Dynamics - Scenario Planning & Simulation 🎯",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Oil & Gas Midstream\n\n**Use case:** Scenario Planning & Business Simulation\n\nMidStream Dynamics — scenario planning analytics for capacity expansion, M&A, regulatory shocks, and commodity-cycle stress tests. The CFO and VP Strategy use this space to rank scenarios by risk-weighted NPV; the COO and Network Planning leadership use it to size capex commitments and sequence project execution under uncertainty.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Weighted NPV ($MM) — probability-weighted scenario value\n- Projected EBITDA ($MM) — bottom-line scenario outcome\n- Projected throughput (mbpd) — operational scenario output\n- CapEx required ($MM) — capital commitment to execute scenario\n- Regulatory risk score (0-100) — policy / permitting exposure\n- Throughput change (%) vs. baseline — operational delta\n- Variance to baseline (%) — financial delta vs. base case\n- Confidence level — High / Medium / Low statistical confidence\n\n**Data sources**\n- `simulation_runs` — individual scenario runs with NPV, capex, probability weights\n- `outcome_snapshots` — periodic projected EBITDA, throughput, regulatory risk\n- `scenario_kpi_monthly` — monthly rollup of weighted NPV, risk, variance",
