  "metric_views": [
    {
      "view_name": "simulation_runs_metrics",
      "source_table": "simulation_runs",
      "dimensions": [
        {
          "name": "run_date",
          "expr": "run_date"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_id",
          "expr": "scenario_id"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_type",
          "expr": "scenario_type"
        }
      ],
      "measures": [
        {
          "name": "avg_npv_mm",
          "expr": "AVG(npv_mm)",
          "comment": "Avg NPV millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "avg_revenue_impact_mm",
          "expr": "AVG(revenue_impact_mm)",
          "comment": "Avg revenue impact millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_runs",
          "expr": "COUNT(DISTINCT run_id)",
          "comment": "Total simulation runs"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_capex_mm",
          "expr": "SUM(capex_required_mm)",
          "comment": "Total capex millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_throughput_change_percent",
          "expr": "SUM(throughput_change_pct)",
          "comment": "Total throughput change pct"
        },
        {
          "name": "total_probability_weight",
          "expr": "SUM(probability_weight)",
          "comment": "Total probability weight"
        },
        {
          "name": "max_throughput_change_percent",
          "expr": "MAX(throughput_change_pct)",
          "comment": "Maximum throughput change pct"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "view_name": "outcome_snapshots_metrics",
      "source_table": "outcome_snapshots",
      "dimensions": [
        {
          "name": "snapshot_date",
          "expr": "snapshot_date"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_id",
          "expr": "scenario_id"
        },
        {
          "name": "scenario_type",
          "expr": "scenario_type"
        },
        {
          "name": "confidence_level",
          "expr": "confidence_level"
        }
      ],
      "measures": [
        {
          "name": "avg_ebitda_mm",
          "expr": "AVG(projected_ebitda_mm)",
          "comment": "Avg EBITDA millions"
        },
        {
          "name": "avg_throughput_mbpd",
          "expr": "AVG(projected_throughput_mbpd)",
          "comment": "Avg throughput MBPD"
        },
        {
          "name": "avg_regulatory_risk",
          "expr": "AVG(regulatory_risk_score)",
          "comment": "Avg regulatory risk score"
        },
        {
          "name": "max_projected_ebitda_mm",
          "expr": "MAX(projected_ebitda_mm)",
          "comment": "Maximum projected ebitda mm"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports Scenario Planning & Business Simulation for a midstream operator evaluating capacity expansion, brownfield optimization, M&A, regulatory change (e.g., methane rules, tariff filings), and commodity-cycle stress (WTI swings, gas basis blowouts). Stakeholders include the CFO (risk-weighted NPV, capex pacing), VP Strategy (M&A and growth optionality), COO (operational feasibility), and Board (capital allocation). Industry context: midstream capex commitments are typically multi-year, $50MM-$2B per project, and IRR hurdle rates run 10-15% post-tax.\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- NPV = npv_mm on simulation_runs; risk-weighted via probability_weight\n- Revenue impact = revenue_impact_mm on simulation_runs\n- CapEx = capex_required_mm; project-level capital commitment\n- Throughput change % = throughput_change_pct vs. baseline operations\n- Projected EBITDA = projected_ebitda_mm on outcome_snapshots\n- Regulatory risk = regulatory_risk_score (0-100; lower is better)\n- Weighted NPV = weighted_npv_mm on scenario_kpi_monthly; primary ranking metric\n- Variance to baseline = variance_to_baseline_pct; >|10%| triggers re-plan\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - simulation_runs_metrics (source: simulation_runs) — dims: run_date, scenario_id, scenario_type; measures: avg_npv_mm, avg_revenue_impact_mm, total_runs, total_capex_mm, total_throughput_change_percent, total_probability_weight, max_throughput_change_percent.\n  - outcome_snapshots_metrics (source: outcome_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, scenario_id, scenario_type, confidence_level; measures: avg_ebitda_mm, avg_throughput_mbpd, avg_regulatory_risk, max_projected_ebitda_mm.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. scenario_name, probability_weight, weighted_npv_mm, variance_to_baseline_pct, confidence_level).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Top 10 scenarios by average NPV across all simulation runs.",
    "Show monthly trend of average projected EBITDA by scenario type for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Which scenarios have the highest regulatory risk score, and what is their projected throughput?",
    "What is the total capex required across all Infrastructure scenarios, by scenario type?",
    "How has average regulatory risk trended month-over-month across the scenario portfolio?",
    "Top 10 scenarios by total throughput change percent.",
    "Which low-confidence scenarios have NPV above the portfolio average — and what is the risk score for each?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total capex millions?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, MEASURE(total_capex_mm) AS total_capex_mm",
        "FROM {fqn}.simulation_runs_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total throughput change pct changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT run_date, MEASURE(total_throughput_change_percent) AS total_throughput_change_percent",
        "FROM {fqn}.simulation_runs_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY run_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in avg throughput mbpd?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(avg_throughput_mbpd) AS avg_throughput_mbpd",
        "FROM {fqn}.outcome_snapshots_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Rank scenario ids by avg ebitda millions",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT scenario_id, MEASURE(avg_ebitda_mm) AS avg_ebitda_mm",
        "FROM {fqn}.outcome_snapshots_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY avg_ebitda_mm DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total revenue impact millions usd over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
